 Cleanup;cfgFilename;backup;qdmx;⎕TRAP
⍝ Puts the configuration file back, the one `Initial` copied aside before the test
⍝ cases got to overwrite and delete it.\\
⍝ Whatever the test cases left behind under that name is thrown away first: it is
⍝ their making, not the user's.
 cfgFilename←##.GitHub.GetConfigFilename
 backup←cfgFilename,'.saved-by-GitHub-tests'
 :If ##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.IsFile backup
     :Trap (~##.GitHub.DEBUG)/19 22
         :If ##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.IsFile cfgFilename
             {}##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.DeleteFile cfgFilename
         :EndIf
         cfgFilename ⎕NMOVE backup
     :Else
         qdmx←⎕DMX
         ⎕←'*** The configuration file could not be put back: ',qdmx.EM
         ⎕←'*** It is still here: ',backup
         ⎕TRAP←0 'S'
         ∘∘∘
     :EndTrap
 :EndIf
⍝Done
